FlashTakeDeficitTest
├── when amount0 LTE budget0 AND amount1 LTE budget1
│ └── it takes nothing
├── when amount0 GT budget0
│ └── it takes amount0 - budget0 of token0
├── when amount1 GT budget1
│ └── it takes amount1 - budget1 of token1
└── when both amounts exceed budgets
    └── it takes the shortfall on both tokens
